///
/// - `{code:lang}` → the explicit hint (possibly empty — `{code:}` means
///   "no language"), everything after the tag is body.
/// - `{code}lang` / `{code}lang body` → the first token is the hint
///   (the gh-122 template form), the remainder is body.
